# TLX (three.js)

- Opt-in via `apex26.gfxBackend=three`. Probe/tests pin WebGL2 with
  `apex26.tlxForceGL=1` — three's WebGPU path dies under SwiftShader
  (`mappedAtCreation`); use `--tlx-webgpu` only on purpose.
- Canvas alpha must be opaque for correct compositing (transparent-cars class).
- Read `docs/RENDERERS.md` §Cross-backend parity when a look differs vs GLX/WGX.
- Live probe: `mcp-probe` / `mcp-cli.mjs probe --backend three`.
